{"unit_id":"zjh02249__dsh-desktop-operator#card-zh","repo":"zjh02249/dsh-desktop-operator","commit":"f04c3cdbc9ab47a12b1c9e7674cabe05ca67306f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Desktop Operator 是面向 DSH 桌面客户端的 Windows Computer Use 插件，通过 MCP 桥接包内原生运行时，把窗口观察和桌面操作工具接入 Agent。它支持列出应用与窗口、读取截图和 UI Automation 元素、按语义查找控件，并执行点击、输入、按键、滚动和拖动等操作；还可验证动作后的界面状态并在轮次结束时清理临时状态。适合需要让 DSH Agent 操作 Windows 桌面应用的用户。需要 Windows x64 或 arm64、兼容的 DSH/Node 环境，并在 Agent Preset 中挂载插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:451-513","src/index.ts:130-138","runtime/windows/main.go:22-29","runtime/windows/main.go:35-70","runtime/windows/runtime.ps1:1-23"]}
